Description: lh-entropy - NIST SP 800-90B Markov Min-Entropy Lower Bound
 C11 hardware entropy daemon harvesting SRAM startup PUF and ADC thermal jitter, enforcing NIST SP 800-90B continuous health tests (RCT/APT), MCV min-entropy estimation, and vetted SHA-256 conditioning for /dev/random.
